    - target: {fileID: 831805394470804104, guid: 3c713a850089ad14b8c6928ea6fddc2f, type: 3}
      propertyPath: letterMessage
      value: "Dear Chrys,\r\n\r\nI don\u2019t know if you\u2019re even reading these
        anymore, but I can\u2019t stop writing them.\r\n\r\nI miss you. I don\u2019t
        know what happened, did I do something wrong? I feel like I lost you. I don\u2019t
        want that.\r\n\r\nPlease write back. Even if it\u2019s just a couple words.
        Just tell me you\u2019re still there.\n\r\nLove,\r\nDaisy\r"
