    - target: {fileID: 831805394470804104, guid: c8805b38dc36a4845b516bc4b7c4568e, type: 3}
      propertyPath: letterMessage
      value: "Dear Daisy,\n\r\nI got your letter today, and I think I read it three
        times. I miss you too, but I\u2019m glad you\u2019re settling in. Your new
        room sounds amazing! Send me a drawing of the view, since I know you\u2019re
        already sketching it.\r\nThings here are the same, mostly. School\u2019s
        boring without you, and lunch is way too quiet. I keep turning to say something
        to you, but you\u2019re not there, and it sucks. But I know you\u2019re going
        to do great things over there.\n\r\nTell me all about your first day of school.
        I want to hear everything.\n\r\nLove,\r\nChrys\r\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
